. Once in a while I get a chance to solo, that's great, but you don't solo in every tune. I think what started that is all the duos -- the piano and bass -- because the clubs couldn't afford any more than two men, and they wanted some kind of entertainment in a bar to attract people, so they'd get a very good piano play ...", "type": "string"}, "datatype": "string"}, "type": "statement", "id": "Q14513$C2CD9619-142E-4789-A6A6-59EDEF33D9D4", "rank": "normal"}], "P20": [{"mainsnak": {"snaktype": "value", "property": "P20", "hash": "aa4d3003cbda5b07981db08dcf1ff1d453d60d8d", "datavalue": {"value": "https://semlab.s3.amazonaws.com/texts/e3f78660c0230f3d125c1acd4be3c146/70.txt", "type": "string"}, "datatype": "url"}, "type": "statement", "id": "Q14513$9FC552C0-A2EC-4F4D-B325-C364D5B38E70", "rank": "normal"}], "P21": [{"mainsnak": {"snaktype": "value", "property": "P21", "hash": "95008d181c845123002c9a040e9302ec4891f61b", "datavalue": {"value": {"entity-type": "item", "numeric-id": 19, "id": "Q19"}, "type": "wikibase-entityid"}, "datatype": "wikibase-item"}, "type": "statement", "id": "Q14513$F2E39993-091A-43B4-AD63-BAB3D116319E", "rank": "normal"}, {"mainsnak": {"snaktype": "value", "property": "P21", "hash": "fbcb3bb76249bc6f8cd2318c17611077559f86a8", "datavalue": {"value": {"entity-type": "item", "numeric-id": 890, "id": "Q890"}, "type": "wikibase-entityid"}, "datatype": "wikibase-item"}, "type": "statement", "id": "Q14513$13286020-C63B-4F1C-A86E-B26809A36C94", "rank": "normal"}, {"mainsnak": {"snaktype": "value", "property": "P21", "hash": "3621a3a8d976ad7d83f58138155b4f5461a98df3", "datavalue": {"value": {"entity-type": "item", "numeric-id": 247, "id": "Q247"}, "type": "wikibase-entityid"}, "datatype": "wikibase-item"}, "type": "statement", "id": "Q14513$F19260DA-CA1F-4040-A917-1D344B090957", "rank": "normal"}, {"mainsnak": {"snaktype": "value", "property": "P21", "hash": "59f3125f7a212e631fde66888e23abd8e8ecd6d0", "datavalue": {"value": {"entity-type": "item", "numer